/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 83 0 R
/T (Team LAGARI proposes a runway-independent reconnaissance UAV that surveys the planned corridor before the EVA crew enters it. Camera observations and range measurements would complement orbital datasets, producing a layered local hazard map. A route-planning module would then favor lower-risk passages rather than simply the shortest distance. The same mission results are intended for both an operator dashboard and astronaut-oriented wrist and helmet displays.)
/E (Team LAGARI proposes a runway-independent reconnaissance UAV that surveys the planned corridor before the EVA crew enters it. Camera observations and range measurements would complement orbital datasets, producing a layered local hazard map. A route-planning module would then favor lower-risk passages rather than simply the shortest distance. The same mission results are intended for both an operator dashboard and astronaut-oriented wrist and helmet displays.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
