/T (The proposed avionics architecture separates a real-time flight controller from an NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano mission computer. The flight controller maintains stabilization, manages the VTOL-to-cruise transition and supervises landing. The Jetson records and processes time-stamped reconnaissance data. A forward-facing 12 MP camera is intended to view potential obstacles; a second downward-facing 12 MP camera observes ground texture. The TF03-100 single-beam LiDAR provides ground-range information, particularly for altitude assessment around landing.)
/E (The proposed avionics architecture separates a real-time flight controller from an NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano mission computer. The flight controller maintains stabilization, manages the VTOL-to-cruise transition and supervises landing. The Jetson records and processes time-stamped reconnaissance data. A forward-facing 12 MP camera is intended to view potential obstacles; a second downward-facing 12 MP camera observes ground texture. The TF03-100 single-beam LiDAR provides ground-range information, particularly for altitude assessment around landing.)
