/Title (The work completed to date consists of analytical aircraft sizing, preliminary structural and power estimates, an avionics architecture and a website prototype operating on representative terrain and hazard data. The latest report explicitly states that flight, bench and environmental tests have not yet been completed. Priority work includes closing the mass budget \(8.78 kg estimated versus 6.0 kg target\), resolving rotor size and aircraft configuration, validating low-Reynolds aerodynamics and rotor thrust, conducting electrical and hardware-in-the-loop tests, and integrating and validating actual NASA and UAV datasets. These steps are prerequisites for claiming demonstrated field performance.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 378 0 R
>>
