/Title (Team LAGARI proposes a runway-independent reconnaissance UAV that surveys the planned corridor before the EVA crew enters it. Camera observations and range measurements would complement orbital datasets, producing a layered local hazard map. A route-planning module would then favor lower-risk passages rather than simply the shortest distance. The same mission results are intended for both an operator dashboard and astronaut-oriented wrist and helmet displays.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 425 0 R
/First 498 0 R
/Last 498 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
