500 0 obj
<<
/Title (Source images and terrain information must be brought into a consistent spatial reference, resampled where necessary and checked for missing or unreliable measurements. The digital elevation model source for quantitative height and slope analysis has not yet been finalized in the report. Crucially, resampling cannot create new physical detail: every map layer must retain its resolution, origin and uncertainty. Regions with insufficient coverage should be shown as unknown, never automatically classified as safe.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 471 0 R
/First 512 0 R
/Last 513 0 R
/Count -3
>>
endobj
