505 0 obj
<<
/Title (At 8.78 kg, the reference hover requirement rises to about 39 N and ~1.7 kW. Consequently, the 6.0 kg flight-time estimates cannot be presented as validated performance for the current design.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 474 0 R
/First 520 0 R
/Last 521 0 R
/Count -2
>>
endobj
506 0 obj
<<
/Title (The proposed avionics architecture separates a real-time flight controller from an NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano mission computer. The flight controller maintains stabilization, manages the VTOL-to-cruise transition and supervises landing. The Jetson records and processes time-stamped reconnaissance data. A forward-facing 12 MP camera is intended to view potential obstacles; a second downward-facing 12 MP camera observes ground texture. The TF03-100 single-beam LiDAR provides ground-range information, particularly for altitude assessment around landing.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 475 0 R
>>
endobj
