511 0 obj
<<
/Title (The selected Jezero Crater corridor is first examined using orbital products. CTX provides regional context for crater rims, rock clusters and surface texture. HiRISE supports more detailed visual interpretation where appropriate coverage exists. THEMIS contributes information about thermal properties, while CRISM can support geological interpretation through surface-composition and mineral indicators. These layers answer different questions; neither thermal nor mineral data alone establish whether ground is mechanically safe to traverse.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 499 0 R
>>
endobj
